# Frontend Off-Limits Unless Asked

## Invariant

Do not create or edit a web client unless the user explicitly asks for the UI.
The React app is planned. It is not part of the first backend tickets.

## Default scope

Backend modules, the worker, MCP, libs, Compose, and docs. UI files — no.

## STOP list

- New HTTP route → **STOP** adding pages or a TypeScript client
- "Make it work" without mentioning UI → **STOP** → backend only
